h cardiac weakness, emaciation and general debility; in chronic, watery diarrhœa in phthisical subjects; in cases of emaciation with good appetite; in amenorrhœa, with anæmic palpitation and dyspnœa. In chronic pneumonia, when abscess is about to form. Great emaciation. Arteriosclerosis, myocardial degeneration and senile heart. Threatened pyæmia (Pyrog; Methyl blue). 73 [Boericke] syphilis. Periodicity very marked; symptoms recur every two and three weeks. Weakness. Swollen feeling of parts.','Diarrhea, anxiety, asthma, skin diseases, food poisoning',NULL,'Restless, anxious, fear of death, despair of recovery, fastidious',' [Boericke] in open air. Delirium tremens; cursing and raving; vicious. Head is in constant motion. Scalp itches intolerably; circular patches of bare spots; rough, dirty, sensitive, and covered with dry scales; nightly burning and itching; dandruff. Scalp very sensitive; cannot brush hair. [Boericke] feels too large. Left-sided headache up to eyes and into [Boericke] in open air. Delirium tremens; cursing and raving; vicious. Head is in constant motion. Scalp itches intolerably; circular patches of bare spots; rough, dirty, sensitive, and covered with dry scales; nightly burning and itching; dandruff. Scalp very sensitive; cannot brush hair. [Boericke] feels too large. Left-sided headache up to eyes and into',' [Boericke] External inflammation, with extreme painfulness; burning, hot, and excoriating lachrymation. Corneal ulceration. Intense photophobia; better external warmth. Ciliary neuralgia, with fine burning pain. [Boericke] sunken; broad, blue circles around. Violent sneezing. Nose cold. Must be wrapped up with warm cloths. [Boericke] and [Boericke] and into [Boericke] External inflammation, with extreme painfulness; burning, hot, and excoriating lachrymation. Corneal ulceration. Intense photophobia; better external warmth. Ciliary neuralgia, with fine burning pain. [Boericke] sunken; broad, blue circles around. Violent sneezing. Nose cold