num Whenever the symptoms that are representative of the patient himself have been suppressed in any case of syphilis, and nothing remains but weakness and a few results of the storm that has long ago or recently passed, this nosode will cause reaction and restore order and sometimes do much curing, and the symptoms that must always be present, that represent the disordered state of the economy will appear to guide to a restoration of health.  When a syphilitic patient has suffered from a course of typhoid he may be very slow in convalescing, but a single dose of Syphilinum high will cause him to eat and feel stronger and gain rapidly.  How does the old school treatment of syphilis differ from barbarism? one might well ask.','Syphilitic miasm, bone diseases, ulcers, nervous disorders',NULL,'Fear of night, hopeless, memory weak, suicidal, nervous',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Worse: night, from sunset to sunrise, seashore. Better: mountains, during day',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-13 06:28:24','2025-12-29 06:29:35'),(227,'Taraxacum','Tarax','Dandelion','Plant','Kent Materia Medica','Kent\'s Lectures on Materia Medica, p.1407-1412',NULL,'Bilious conditions, yellow tongue with mapped surface, bitter taste','Liver complaints, indigestion, gallstones, jaundice',NULL,'Irritable, indifferent, lazy, disinclined to work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Worse: rest, lying, night. Better: touch, pressure, walking',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-13 06:28:24','2025-12-13 06:55:24'),(229,'Tellurium','Tell','Tellurium','Mineral','Kent Materia Medica','Kent\'s Lectures on Materia Medica, p.1429-1438',NULL,'Ringworm eruptions, ear discharge, herpes circinatus, offensive ear discharge','Ringworm, eczema, ear problems, herpes',NULL,'Forgetful, makes mistakes in speaking, weak memory',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,